  "description": "The Joris Coulomb signature Subrosa Om frame has been a staple in our lineup for years now, and this is the frames biggest upgrade to date. Sticking with the tried and true modern geometry that Joris and riders love, the Om is one of our shortest frame in the collection. With a short Chainstay length of 12.95” it was time to add an invest cast Yoke Bottom Bracket junction. This new junction is designed to create a larger welding surface area around the Bottom Bracket to provide increased strength against bending and allows you to run the widest tires available. A built in seatpost clamp and new decals top off the Om V2 along with new colorway options.\n\nSubrosa investment cast yoke",
